QUERY NAME: qryLastYearsTests
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT MY_MonthlyOutput.TestCode, Sum(MY_MonthlyOutput.Volume) AS YearTotal
FROM MY_MonthlyOutput
WHERE (((fnYearMonth([Year],[month])) Between fnOneYearBackFromMonthReleased() And fnLatestYearMonthReleased()))
GROUP BY MY_MonthlyOutput.TestCode;

